	('AUTOCOMMIT', 'ON', 'ON', 'COMPILE-TIME', 'ON', 'SESSION', 'BOOLEAN', 'If set to 1, the default, all queries are committed immediately. If set to 0, they are only committed upon a COMMIT statement, or rolled back with a ROLLBACK statement. If autocommit is set to 0, and then changed to 1, all open transactions are immediately committed', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'OFF,ON', 'NO', NULL, NULL, 'NO', NULL),
