	('SECURE_TIMESTAMP', NULL, 'NO', 'COMPILE-TIME', 'NO', 'GLOBAL', 'ENUM', 'Restricts direct setting of a session timestamp. Possible levels are: YES - timestamp cannot deviate from the system clock, REPLICATION - replication thread can adjust timestamp to match the master\'s, SUPER - a user with this privilege and a replication thread can adjust timestamp, NO - historical behavior, anyone can modify session timestamp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NO,SUPER,REPLICATION,YES', 'YES', 'REQUIRED', NULL, 'NO', NULL),
